    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970405.0310\n\nWASHINGTON, April 5 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nUS shifts to daylight savings time\n\n\n\n\nMost areas of the United States shift Sunday to daylight savings time, with clocks moving one hour ahead.\n\nThe change was to take place in the eastern zone at 2:00 a.m. (0700 GMT). Some areas of the country exercise local options not to join the summer time.",
